WEBVTT

NOTE
Deling City Parade — Sorceress Edea on her float and President Deling's speech.
Duration: approximately 59 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sorceress Edea in profile, wearing a red bird-like mask and an ornate golden headpiece with a spiral shell and purple stripes.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Close-up of Edea as the camera moves to the front; her red bird-like mask magically disappears, revealing her striking, cold, and elegant face. Calm, detached expression, dark purple lips, wearing a jeweled skullcap

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Camera behind the throne as Rinoa lies on the ground, then slowly stands up.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Edea is sitting on the throne, then stands up slowly.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Theatrical shot of Sorceress Edea, two long translucent silk ribbons flowing behind her as she slowly raises both hands in a mystical, spell-like pose.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
She slowly lowers her hands toward her face, almost kissing them, as the silk ribbons settle and calm, then she lets her hands fall to her sides.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
She slowly and elegantly walks toward the door.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
She touches the door and passes straight through it; it seals behind her, returning to normal.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
She is now on the balcony, walking slowly toward the podium where microphones are waiting.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.000
The podium stands elevated, nearly as tall as the triumphal gate bearing the Galbadia emblem, with a cheering crowd below.
